{"title":"2023 SSMO Relay Round 2 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_2_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/3/3c3051519cf5d47d7be8c47d37e1fa6414f43dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=TNYWR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" />. Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/9/7a91775abde4c30fb4a124b6567ae8caa1592a73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L = \\left\\lfloor\\sqrt{T}\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"86\" height=\"34\" /> points are evenly spaced around the circle. Find the number of ways to select <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5bb76208dae30e44513fa10ff49ba1329094713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> points  such that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />-gon formed strictly contains the center of the circle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_2_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018023842\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreproces